flowchart TD
Start["**Start**<br/>Begin MOO optimization using NSGA II style GA"]
InitPopulation["**Init Population**<br/>Create POP_SIZE individuals<br/>Each individual has 10 buffer capacities<br/>Values per variable {1-10}"]
EvaluatePopulation["**Evaluate Population**<br/>Parallel evaluate individuals using Pool"]
Pool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Processes N_CORES"]
EvaluateIndividual["**Evaluate Individual**<br/>Check feasibility sum capacities less or equal 60<br/>If feasible run simulation REPETITIONS times"]
Feasibility["**Feasibility Check**<br/>Constraint sum capacities <= 60"]
RunSimulation["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation runs simpy model for a given seed and buffer caps<br/>Returns throughput and wip metrics"]
SimulationCode["**Production Simulation Code**<br/>Classes Machine and DelayBuffer implement queue physics<br/>Inputs buffer capacities and seed<br/>Outputs throughput wip and machine energy"]
Archive["**Solution Archive**<br/>Store feasible individuals with wip and throughput"]
Selection["**Selection**<br/>Tournament selection using dominance relation"]
Crossover["**Crossover**<br/>Single point crossover with probability pc"]
Mutation["**Mutation**<br/>Per gene random reset with probability pm"]
OffspringEval["**Offspring Evaluation**<br/>Evaluate offspring in Pool and filter infeasible"]
CombineSelection["**Combine and Select Next Gen**<br/>Combine parents and offspring<br/>Non dominated sort and crowding distance to select POP_SIZE"]
RecordGeneration["**Record Generation**<br/>Append feasible offspring results to Archive"]
LoopGen["**Generation Loop**<br/>Repeat for N_GEN generations"]
SaveResults["**Save Results**<br/>Write all_solutions to CSV in results directory"]
End["**End**<br/>MOO complete output CSV ready for analysis"]

Start --> InitPopulation
InitPopulation --> EvaluatePopulation
EvaluatePopulation --> Pool
Pool --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> Feasibility
Feasibility -- feasible --> RunSimulation
Feasibility -- infeasible --> EvaluatePopulation
RunSimulation --> SimulationCode
SimulationCode --> EvaluateIndividual
EvaluateIndividual --> Archive
Archive --> Selection
Selection --> Crossover
Crossover --> Mutation
Mutation --> OffspringEval
OffspringEval --> Pool
OffspringEval --> RecordGeneration
RecordGeneration --> CombineSelection
CombineSelection --> InitPopulation
CombineSelection --> LoopGen
LoopGen --> Selection
LoopGen --> Crossover
LoopGen --> Mutation
LoopGen --> OffspringEval
LoopGen -->|after N_GEN| SaveResults
SaveResults --> End

%% Additional explanatory nodes for key functions and objectives
NSGAComponents["**NSGA Components**<br/>Non dominated sort and crowding distance<br/>Used in Combine and Select Next Gen"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Objective 1 minimize wip<br/>Objective 2 maximize throughput represented as minimize negative throughput"]
DecisionVars["**Decision Variables**<br/>10 buffer capacities<br/>Each integer in {1-10}"]
EvalConfig["**Evaluation Config**<br/>REPLICATIONS per individual<br/>WARMUP and MEASURE periods used by simulation"]

CombineSelection --> NSGAComponents
InitPopulation --> DecisionVars
EvaluatePopulation --> EvalConfig
Archive --> Objectives